WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Commander gets complicated. Keeping track of it shouldn't.

00:06.000 --> 00:16.000
Meet BoardState Lite: your intelligent companion for physical Commander.

00:16.000 --> 00:29.000
When one action affects every qualifying creature, Lite handles the repetitive counter bookkeeping automatically.

00:29.000 --> 00:40.000
When the game calls for a decision, you stay in control.

00:40.000 --> 00:51.000
Swipe into Ability Focus to see what your permanents can do and remember what is already used.

00:51.000 --> 00:59.000
Review the action, undo it cleanly, and keep playing.

00:59.000 --> 01:08.000
From dungeons and initiative to custom counters, Lite keeps the details organized.

01:08.000 --> 01:15.000
Play the cards. Let Lite handle the bookkeeping. BoardState Lite.
